DTSTAMP:20260519T060000Z
SUMMARY:Spark Careers next-week bundle should be ready in Downloads
DESCRIPTION:The Windows scheduled task SparkCareers\\WeeklyContentBuild fired at 08:30 this morning and should have dropped the next week's bundle into Downloads\\spark-w{NN}-buffer\\.\n\nWhat to do now:\n  1. Open Downloads\\spark-w{NN}-buffer\\\n  2. Review the .docx if you want to edit any captions\n  3. Open Buffer\, for each channel: gear -> General -> Bulk Upload\, upload the matching *-final.csv\, review the preview\, confirm\n\nIf the folder isn't there\, the task failed -- check the latest log in social-assets\\runs\\wrapper-*.log and the toast notification history.\n\nFirst real run: Fri May 29 2026 (generates Week 23\, Jun 1-5).
DTSTART;TZID=America/Edmonton:20260529T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Edmonton:20260529T094500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
LOCATION:Downloads\spark-w{week}-buffer\
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
